rule: MdmPermissions.MATRIX·READ_ACTIONS/EDIT_ACTIONS/CONFIRM_ACTIONS 는 권한 매트릭스의 단일 진실 소스다(READ⊂EDIT⊂CONFIRM)
file: src/backend/mdm/lib/src/main/java/com/dongkuk/dmes/mdm/contract/security/MdmPermissions.java
test: cd src/backend && JAVA_HOME=/opt/homebrew/opt/openjdk@21/libexec/openjdk.jdk/Contents/Home ./gradlew :mdm:api:test --tests "com.dongkuk.dmes.mdm.MdmOasisActionVocabularyTest" --no-daemon --console=plain
e2e: no
--- find
    public static final List<String> CONFIRM_ACTIONS = List.of(SEARCH, VIEW, EXPORT, COMPARE,
            SAVE, DELETE, REG, IMPORT, VALIDATE, EXECUTE, COPY, RESTORE, LOCK, UNLOCK, HANDOVER, MdmActions.CONFIRM);
--- replace
    public static final List<String> CONFIRM_ACTIONS = List.of(SEARCH, VIEW, EXPORT, COMPARE,
            SAVE, DELETE, REG, IMPORT, VALIDATE, EXECUTE, COPY, RESTORE, LOCK, UNLOCK, HANDOVER);
